  "partnerRating": null,
  "description": "<p>The globally renowned GBSB Global Business School is a European school of higher learning with campuses in Malta, Barcelona, and Madrid, and it also offers fully virtual courses. Using innovation, digitisation, and entrepreneurship as its guiding principles, GBSB Global fosters leadership in business and academia by offering cutting-edge, English-taught undergraduate and graduate programs.</p><p><strong>About the University</strong></p><p>GBSB Global, which holds accreditation from the ACBSP, MFHEA, ASIC, and ECBE, consistently draws students from across the world. Its student population is remarkably diverse, with over 100 different nations represented.</p><p>With a faculty that includes extremely successful CEOs and business owners, you are taught how to overcome real-world obstacles and become highly employable in your field of study.</p><p>The QS Rating System (2022) has given GBSB Global a five-star rating in categories like - inclusiveness, business and management studies, online learning, employment opportunities, teaching, and academic development. According to QS Top MBA (2023), the online MBA program is ranked 20th in the world.</p><p><strong>Why choose the GBSB Global Business School?</strong></p><ul><li>GBSB is listed as one of Europe's top business schools</li><li>Newsweek and Forbes have acknowledged it as a pioneer in international education</li><li>The institute has four campuses: Birkirkara in Malta, Barcelona and Madrid in Spain, and a fully virtual campus</li><li>With students from more than 100 countries, the institute values diversity and inclusivity</li><li>The school has a distinguished faculty of academics and entrepreneurs from around the world</li><li>The institute supports small group teaching with up to 30 students in each class for individualised education</li></ul><p><strong>Student life</strong></p><ul><li>GBSB Global places a strong emphasis on innovation and technology, in both in-person and online programs.</li><li>The institute is one of the few business schools in Europe that provide you with a fully digital experience from start to finish.</li><li>They do this by having digital touch boards in every classroom, collaborative applications, an inclusive learning environment, and a wealth of instructional digital tools at their disposal.</li><li>In a stimulating and dynamic learning atmosphere, students from all over the world (as well as equally diverse instructors and staff) learn from and with one another.</li><li>At GBSB Global, socialising is always possible because of the many in-person and online events, seminars, workshops, and extracurricular activities offered.</li><li>The institute’s various programs provide you with the tools you need to live, work, and handle today's pressing global concerns.</li><li>You’ll acquire the cultural intelligence and comprehension required to work well with people who hold radically different opinions and values.</li><li>Their instructors', graduates', and students' diversity is a valuable educational asset that encourages enhanced creativity and peer-to-peer learning.</li></ul>",
