    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>GBSB Global, which holds accreditation from the ACBSP, MFHEA, ASIC, and ECBE, consistently draws students from across the world. Its student population is remarkably diverse, with over 100 different nations represented.</p><p>With a faculty that includes extremely successful CEOs and business owners, you are taught how to overcome real-world obstacles and become highly employable in your field of study.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<ul><li>GBSB Global places a strong emphasis on innovation and technology, in both in-person and online programs.</li><li>The institute is one of the few business schools in Europe that provide you with a fully digital experience from start to finish.</li><li>They do this by having digital touch boards in every classroom, collaborative applications, an inclusive learning environment, and a wealth of instructional digital tools at their disposal.</li><li>In a stimulating and dynamic learning atmosphere, students from all over the world (as well as equally diverse instructors and staff) learn from and with one another.</li><li>At GBSB Global, socialising is always possible because of the many in-person and online events, seminars, workshops, and extracurricular activities offered.</li><li>The institute’s various programs provide you with the tools you need to live, work, and handle today's pressing global concerns.</li><li>You’ll acquire the cultural intelligence and comprehension required to work well with people who hold radically different opinions and values.</li><li>Their instructors', graduates', and students' diversity is a valuable educational asset that encourages enhanced creativity and peer-to-peer learning.</li></ul>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<ul><li>The institute has partnered with several student lodge providers to assist in locating the best deal for when you get to Malta or Spain.</li><li>The school does not have its own residency hall but has relations with top student residence services in every city where their physical schools are located. So you may choose from the best options in terms of cost, location, etc.</li></ul><p><strong>Accommodation options in Barcelona</strong></p><ul><li>The Social Hub Barcelona Poblenou</li><li>Happycasa</li><li>Xior</li></ul><p><strong>Accommodation options in Madrid</strong></p><ul><li>Shmadrid</li><li>The Student Hotel</li><li>Xior</li></ul><p><strong>Accommodation options in Malta</strong></p><ul><li>Easy Rent</li></ul>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sports",
      "value": "<p>You can take part in various sporting events presented by GBSB Global, such as beach volleyball tournaments and soccer matches. The school is also adaptable enough to host extracurricular events and activities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Cafeteria",
      "value": "<p>Adjacent to the garden is a newly constructed, marginally smaller cafeteria area. For eating and studying, this space has been outfitted with an additional high-top counter and stools. There are a few more options in this area, including a new coffee maker, a cold beverage maker, and some nibbles.</p><p>Every floor has a good number of well-placed, relaxed sitting areas. These spaces are equipped with coffee tables, cosy armchairs, and charging stations. You can read, eat, or just hang out with friends in these areas.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
